      "title": "Japanese prosecutors charge US marine suspected of robbing and killing woman",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/26/japanese-prosecuters-charge-marine-killing",
      "description": "<p>Devin Jacob Ballard, 20, denies charges that he fatally strangled Anna Yagi, 39, in a hotel on the island of Okinawa</p><p>Prosecutors in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/japan\">Japan</a> have filed formal charges against a <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-military\">US</a> marine suspected of murdering and robbing a woman while stationed on the country’s island of Okinawa, according to Japanese media.</p><p>Devin Jacob Ballard, a 20-year-old lance corporal assigned to Marine Corps Air Station Futenma in Okinawa, is charged with fatally strangling Anna Yagi, 39, at a hotel in the city and stealing from her a backpack containing a wallet, the public broadcaster <a href=\"https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261026de65774\">NHK reported</a>.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/26/japanese-prosecuters-charge-marine-killing\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-26T13:41:41"
